# ---- INTERATOMIC POTENTIALS -- NEVER COMMIT ---------------------------
# hull0k references potentials by absolute path + sha256 in the config and
# never ships them. They are large, they carry their OWN licences and
# citation requirements (which are not this repository's BSD-3-Clause), and
# some are unpublished or under redistribution restrictions. If you need a
# potential beside the code to make a config runnable, symlink it or set the
# path in your own config -- do not add the file.
*.eam
*.eam.*
*.alloy
*.fs
*.setfl
*.adp
*.meam
*.library
*.snapcoeff
*.snapparam
*.mtp
*.pace
*.yace
*.gin
*.tersoff
*.sw
*.airebo
*.reax
*.ff
# ML-potential model dumps
*.pb
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.model
# ACE parameterisations are plain .yaml, which cannot be blanket-ignored
# (configs are .yaml too), so they are matched by name instead. If your
# potential does not match one of these, DO NOT add it to the repo anyway.
ACE_*.yaml
ace_*.yaml
*_ACE.yaml
*_ace.yaml
*-ace.yaml
# conventional drop-directories for potentials
POTENTIALS/
potentials/

# ---- never commit ------------------------------------------------------
*.key
.env
